# Credentials for `harness run --tier judge --mode live`.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in a key. `.env` is gitignored and a
# fail-closed pre-commit guard blocks a populated one, so the copy cannot
# reach history by accident; this template can, and does, which is the point
# of it existing -- a requirement nobody can see is a requirement that gets
# discovered as an error message.
#
# NOTHING here is needed for the deterministic tier or for replay. Those are
# the default paths, they issue no model call, and they neither read a
# credential nor import the SDK (D8, D122). This file matters only when you
# deliberately spend money.
#
# The harness reads the environment first and this file second, so an exported
# variable wins over whatever is written here. Only the two names below are
# read; anything else in the file is ignored rather than loaded, so this is not
# a general configuration mechanism.
#
# Whichever value is set is scrubbed from every run-log entry, report and error
# message before it is written.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# An alternative to the above; set one or the other, not both.
# ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=
